Package: panini
Version: 0.2.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Tsiry Sandratraina <tsiry.sndr@rocksky.app>
Homepage: https://github.com/tsirysndr/panini
Description: Press a Gleam (Erlang/BEAM) app into a single self-contained binary
 panini bundles the BEAM runtime with your compiled Gleam app so it runs on a
 machine with nothing installed. Supports OTP version selection and
 cross-compilation. Statically linked (musl); no runtime dependencies.
